## Interface: 11200
## Title: ATSW Quick Tools
## Notes: Queue ETA bar + one-click profession switcher for AdvancedTradeSkillWindow.
## Notes: Uses ClassicAPI's GetSpellInfo (cast times) and nampower's GetCastInfo (live cast timer) when present, degrades gracefully without them.
## Notes: Also shows per-reagent Aux prices on the selected recipe's reagent icons, if Aux is installed.
## Version: 1.6
## OptionalDeps: AdvancedTradeSkillWindow, AdvancedTradeSkillWindow-vanilla, ATSW, ClassicAPI, nampower, SuperWoW, UnitXP_SP3, aux-addon, Aux
## SavedVariables: atsw_qt_recipetime, atsw_qt_seenprofessions

